    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>deferred-fixes-2026-11-25c</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>CommunicationThreadReadService.cs by-regarding read, its response DTO and the client Messages list that shows it; no other wave task touches them.</parallel-reason>
