  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: a record whose filed messages exceed the scan (or thread budget) returns the flag set; a record within bounds returns it false/absent.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: with more filed threads than the budget, the kept threads are the newest; with many anchored messages, filed threads beyond the anchored ones are still found (the scan is not spent on anchored threads).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: a message the caller cannot read never appears, and the flag carries no count; existing by-regarding, CommunicationThreadRead and Signals contract tests pass (update a baseline only for the additive field).</criterion>
